SUMMARY:Mills of Lancaster County: An Afternoon with Historian Donald Kautz
DESCRIPTION:Step back in time with author Donald Kautz and the Manheim Town
 ship Historical Society as we explore the history of Lancaster County’s 
 water-powered grist mills. From the ingenious engineering of the waterwhee
 l to the personal stories of the families who kept them running\, this pre
 sentation brings our local heritage to life. Join us to discover the secre
 t history of these iconic structures and see how they continue to shape ou
 r landscape today.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nSchedule listed: Sat\, Nov 14\, 2026 
 01:00 PM EST – Sat\, Nov 14\, 2026 04:00 PM EST\n\nSchedule supplied by 
 Lancaster Libraries\n\nTimes converted from America/New_York to UTC for ca
 lendar compatibility.\n\n\n\nRegistration: https://calendar.lancasterlibra
 ries.org/event/reserved-historical-society-event-161153\n\nAdding this cal
